---
import LabPage from '../../components/labs/LabPage.astro';
import RpsLab from '../../components/labs/RpsLab.svelte';
import { LABS } from '../../lib/labs/labs';

const lab = LABS.find((l) => l.slug === 'rock-paper-scissors')!;
---

<LabPage {lab}>
  <p>
    Each round, you and the bot each pick rock, paper or scissors at the same time: that pick is your throw. Rock beats scissors, scissors beats paper, and
    paper beats rock. The same throw is a draw. The bot starts by throwing at random, but it watches what you throw. There are 30 rounds. Try to win more of
    them than the bot, and see how quickly it learns your habits.
  </p>
  <RpsLab client:load />
</LabPage>
